{
  "action": "transmit_interview",
  "words": "Station line, do you copy? This is Rita Hanson. I have the Alma Rialto reel. I am sending it to Pittsburgh now. Confirm receipt.",
  "intention": "To ensure the recording reaches Alma’s daughter in Pittsburgh before the evening ends, fulfilling the promise made to Alma and securing the interview for the record.",
  "detail": "I will ignore the ballroom lights and the party. Phil is gone. Larry has his copy. My copy is the one that matters. I will sit at the transmission desk, load the reel, and push the signal out. Silence is fine after the send."
}
